WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.900
Ask an AI for a website.
[A low drone. Each word lands with a thud.]

00:03.000 --> 00:05.200
A generic AI template builds itself, labelled:
violet gradient, glowing orb, centered headline,
three equal cards, invented stats.

00:05.250 --> 00:06.900
It multiplies into a wall of identical sites.
You get this. Every time.

00:07.000 --> 00:08.400
[Silence. An orange dot falls and strikes the wall.]
[Impact. The templates scatter.]

00:08.900 --> 00:11.400
DENT. stamps into the paper, letter by letter.
[Four letterpress thuds, then a woodblock tok.]

00:11.500 --> 00:13.950
DENT 2.3, out now.
Make a dent with your product's design.

00:14.000 --> 00:16.950
The design skill for AI agents.
Works in Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, Copilot,
Gemini CLI, any SKILL.md agent.

00:17.000 --> 00:22.950
01. It asks before it guesses.
Terminal: /dent a landing page for my coffee app.
"How far should I take it?" All-out is chosen.
Pipeline: directions, create, type, motion-graphics,
assets, verify, score, improve.

00:23.000 --> 00:28.950
02. It names the cliché. Then diverges.
Category cliché struck out: violet gradient, glowing orb,
centered headline, three equal cards, invented stats.
Style board settles on Swiss + Kinetic Type.
41 styles, 25 directions, 18 hero-type moves.

00:29.000 --> 00:33.950
03. It checks its own work.
A page resizes through 320, 375, 390, 768, 1024 and 1440 px.
No sideways scroll at 6 widths. Text contrast at least 4.5:1.
Every input labelled. Reduced motion respected.
No autoplay audio. Passed.

00:34.000 --> 00:37.950
DENT benchmark, 7 web builds, Claude Code + Opus 5.5, Nov 2026.
Builds that passed every automated check:
0 of 7 without DENT, 7 of 7 with DENT.
Same prompts and model. Caveats: github.com/jeelnadaa/DENT

00:38.000 --> 00:40.950
Interfaces. Motion. 3D. Sound. Video.

00:41.000 --> 00:43.450
This film was made with /dent:video.

00:43.500 --> 00:48.000
DENT. Make a dent with your product's design.
Free and open source, Apache-2.0.
dent.solarquack.in · github.com/jeelnadaa/DENT
[Sonic logo: a tok, two rising notes, a major chord.]
